{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Admin\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content AGENTS.md; rg -n \\\"smart_sector_library_20260918|逐股|review-batch|heartbeat\\\" F:\\\\CodexHome\\\\memories\\\\MEMORY.md; Get-Content tradex/docs/smart-sector-library-method.md; Get-Content work/smart_sector_library_20260918/checkpoint.md -Tail 100; Get-Content work/smart_sector_library_20260918/scheduled/heartbeat.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Admin\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content AGENTS.md; rg -n \\\"smart_sector_library_20260918|逐股|review-batch|heartbeat\\\" F:\\\\CodexHome\\\\memories\\\\MEMORY.md; Get-Content tradex/docs/smart-sector-library-method.md; Get-Content work/smart_sector_library_20260918/checkpoint.md -Tail 100; Get-Content work/smart_sector_library_20260918/scheduled/heartbeat.json\"","aggregated_output":"# Project-level development constraints\r\n\r\n## Mandatory stock market-sector attribution\r\n\r\n- Before changing stock-sector classification, read `tradex/docs/smart-sector-library-method.md`. Market attribution means the market-recognized investment theme backed by real business, not the largest revenue segment or a vendor's industry/concept list order.\r\n- `tradex.smart_sector_library` is the sole authority for stock market-sector membership. All pages, selection displays, portfolio analysis, limit-up grouping, and MCP consumers must obtain membership through its public catalog reader. Do not implement consumer-side keyword classifiers, stock-code overrides, provider-industry fallback, or parallel membership caches.\r\n- Ordinary consumers show exactly one primary market sector. Secondary concepts and chain details belong in the library's own page or explicitly designated detail views. Missing, expired or conflicting evidence is displayed as `待核验`; supplier labels must not fill the gap.\r\n- Keep the taxonomy's original business/statistical industry and historical date-specific event attribution separate. Sector quotes/fund flows keep their existing provider contracts; statistical peer comparisons remain explicitly statistical. Never rewrite archived strategy evidence with current membership.\r\n- New assignments require traceable business and market evidence, review/effective dates, and a reason. Follow the shared evidence gates and retain prior versions. An expired assignment cannot be renewed merely because its source was read again.\r\n- Run the focused smart-sector consumer-boundary and attribution regression tests when changing these paths. These rules apply to all future work in this project.\r\n\r\n## Lean path for small tasks\r\n\r\n- Treat a task as small when it is one local, reversible concern with narrow acceptance criteria and it does not cross architecture, schema, authentication, security, licensing, deployment, external-write, or release boundaries.\r\n- For a small task, do not spawn subagents and do not invoke a requirement or plan audit unless the user explicitly asks for either one.\r\n- Batch the necessary reads into one pass, make one coherent edit batch, run the single nearest focused test or validator, and stop as soon as the stated acceptance criteria pass.\r\n- Do not add a full suite, build, browser run, online check, repeated passing test, or speculative follow-up audit to a small task. A failed focused check may be rerun only after its concrete cause has changed.\r\n- If the initial read shows that the task crosses one of the excluded boundaries, leave the small-task path and state the concrete reason before expanding execution.\r\n\r\n## Regression safety and causal verification\r\n\r\n- Treat preservation of relevant existing correct behavior as part of every fix or optimization's acceptance criteria, not as an optional follow-up. Before editing, identify the exact requested change, the real entrypoint and runtime owner, the affected callers or consumers, and the closest behaviors that must remain unchanged.\r\n- Establish causality before changing code whenever the issue can be reproduced safely. Use the smallest deterministic test, probe, log, API readback, or visible-state check that distinguishes a regression caused by the current code from a pre-existing defect, stale process, cache, browser asset, or changed data state. Do not roll back or modify code based only on temporal correlation.\r\n- Make the narrowest coherent diff that satisfies the request. Do not combine it with unrelated refactors, renames, formatting, cleanup, dependency changes, or silent changes to defaults, fallback behavior, error handling, timestamps, units, freshness, or data semantics.\r\n- For changes to shared functions, contracts, refresh/cache/single-flight ownership, persisted state, or interface payloads, inspect the relevant callers before editing. If that inspection reveals a cross-boundary impact, leave the small-task path and state the concrete expanded risk before proceeding.\r\n- When meaningful, add or update a regression test that proves the requested scenario and the nearest protected sibling behavior. If a useful automated test is not feasible, state why and use the closest deterministic evidence instead; never present an untested assumption as proof.\r\n- After one coherent edit batch, run the nearest affected test or domain suite once. For runtime or user-visible defects, also use the cheapest direct readback that proves the active entrypoint, served asset, API, or managed process actually loaded the change; add a browser run only when the affected interaction or layout cannot be verified more cheaply. Source inspection or local test success alone is not live-runtime proof.\r\n- Before handoff, inspect the final diff for unintended deletions, broadened conditions, changed defaults, and edits outside the declared scope. Report the files changed, protected behaviors checked, validations passed or failed, layers intentionally not verified, and what remains for CI. Do not promise zero regressions or describe an unverified layer as working.\r\n- If the requested optimization conflicts with an existing correct behavior or business invariant, challenge the request with concrete evidence before changing that behavior. Do not silently choose one side of the conflict.\r\n\r\n## Tradex MCP tool profiles\r\n\r\n- The default `tradex` MCP entry exposes only the eight core discovery and market-read tools in `.codex/config.toml`.\r\n- `tradex_ops`, `tradex_market`, `tradex_research`, `tradex_provider`, and `tradex_lake` are disabled capability profiles with non-overlapping allowlists. Enable only the profile needed by a new task; never preload every profile merely for discovery.\r\n- Treat the enabled MCP and plugin set as a positive allowlist. The default project-specific MCP namespace is only `mcp__tradex__`; `MCP_DOCKER`, the LMGameDev Plugin and `lmgamedev-workhub` must remain disabled in this project even when a user-level install enables them globally.\r\n- Optional Browser, Chrome, Computer Use, artifact, Sites, visualization, merge-helper, Codex App, and `node_repl` surfaces stay disabled by default. Enable only the smallest surface explicitly required by the current task, and disable it again after the task-specific use.\r\n- When an installed plugin, MCP server, or profile changes, run `powershell -NoProfile -File F:\\CodexHome\\scripts\\Test-ProjectToolIsolation.ps1 -ProjectRoot G:\\money`. The check must reject every enabled MCP server outside the project allowlist and any drift from the exact eight-tool Tradex core; checking only a historical server name is insufficient.\r\n- MCP configuration is frozen when a task starts. After changing an enabled profile, start a new task so the tool snapshot is rebuilt.\r\n\r\n## Temporary mobile exclusion\r\n\r\n- Until the project owner explicitly revokes this section, treat desktop web pages and desktop user experience as the only UI target for the project.\r\n- Do not propose, design, implement, optimize, or test mobile pages or mobile-specific user experience. This includes mobile breakpoints, mobile-only layouts or navigation, touch-specific interaction work, and mobile-device compatibility work.\r\n- Do not add mobile requirements, acceptance criteria, test cases, or delivery scope to plans, issues, or implementation work.\r\n- If a later request would require mobile-specific work, identify the conflict and wait for the project owner to explicitly revoke or amend this section before proceeding with that mobile scope.\r\n- This restriction has no automatic expiry. Only an explicit instruction from the project owner to revoke or amend it ends or changes the restriction.\r\n- Existing mobile or generally responsive behavior is not a current development target, but do not deliberately remove or break it unless the project owner separately authorizes that change.\r\n\r\n## Tradex architecture guardrails\r\n\r\n- Build new or changed desktop-web market-data features around a provider-neutral, versioned business contract. Provider field names, units, timestamps, and error conventions must be normalized before they reach dashboard, MCP tool, or data-lake code.\r\n- Dashboard, MCP tools, and data-lake adapters must not add direct imports from `tradex.data_sources`. Existing violations are tracked by `tests/architecture_boundary_baseline.json`; remove them incrementally and never expand that baseline without explicit project-owner approval.\r\n- `tradex.data_gateway` may use only the public `tradex.data_sources` router facade. It must not add imports from provider implementation modules such as `akshare_fetchers`, `fuyao_fetchers`, or other source-specific modules.\r\n- Data-lake code must not add dependencies on dashboard modules. Shared computation belongs in a provider-neutral feature service or gateway module consumed by both interfaces.\r\n- Assign one owner for refresh, stale-data, single-flight, and cache policy for each feature. Dashboard and MCP adapters must not create competing caches for the same canonical result.\r\n- Run the focused architecture boundary test for cross-layer changes. Removing a recorded violation requires deleting its baseline entry in the same change.\r\n208:- Browser visibility pauses frontend polling only; the collector is independent. For a broken fund-flow chart, separately inspect accepted-minute ledger, per-trajectory points/internal gaps, provider timestamps, queue logs, cache, published revision, and page/API output. A complete overall snapshot or heartbeat does not prove trajectory completeness. [Task 1]\n219:- `tests/test_architecture_boundaries.py` is at repository root. A 10-second readiness timeout during competing initialization is not a reason to loosen the threshold: establish heartbeat first, then auxiliary work. The previous recovery passed at close but failed under the next day’s intraday queue scale; verify natural intraday, lunch, close, restart, and page rendering separately. [Task 2]\n1636:- when the user says “先暂停监控 权限问题还没搞定” -> pause only the heartbeat/automation, retaining the execution task, cloud resources, and unmerged MRs. [Task 2]\n1931:- During trading, `MarketWatchCollector` should claim `current_only` work. Display-only board-leader enrichment uses `max_queue_wait=0.0` and skips when `Eastmoney request queue is busy`; historic holes are deferred. Health requires accepted-minute cadence, every series’ last point/internal gaps, queue/deadline logs, and recovery state—not only revision or heartbeat. [Task 1]\n2361:- A lunch heartbeat is not a new market snapshot. Perform at most one midday derivation for the last open snapshot with `11:30 <= local_time < 13:00`, keyed by date. [Task 3]\n2791:- sector_flow_trajectory.v1, finalize_sector_intraday_fund_flow_backfill, push2delay, 14:56, 15:00, heartbeat, source_snapshot_revision\n2849:- `238/238` accepted market-watch minutes does not prove all sector curves are complete. `finalize_sector_intraday_fund_flow_backfill()` refreshes every persisted target through common 14:56, then daily recovery rematerializes the separate 15:00 close snapshot and updates heartbeat per sector. `push2delay` is the same-semantic Eastmoney fallback, not a new business provider. [Task 2]\n2861:- Import runtime annotation names (`date`) before tests; architecture boundary tests live at `tests/test_architecture_boundaries.py`. During long bounded finalization, verify heartbeat so valid work is not treated as collector failure. [Task 2]\n2865:- Adding a UI test before the contract exposed `AttributeError` because `unavailable_gaps` did not yet exist -> add the contract field, validation, store derivation, and UI/schema checks together. A launcher readiness timeout at 10 seconds does not prove restart failure or success; use `scripts/tradex_control.ps1` and confirm actual collector heartbeat/runtime state. [Task 6]\n3438:- This page crashed, 5.48 MB, 5.4 GB, tradex.analysis_worker, AnalysisJobReader, AnalysisJobCommandWriter, PRAGMA query_only=ON, heartbeat, WinError 10053\n3479:- Dashboard GETs must be strictly read-only: `AnalysisJobReader` opens SQLite read-only with `PRAGMA query_only=ON`, and missing worker state returns unavailable/preparing without creating files. POSTs may enqueue only; the worker owns schema initialization, computation, artifacts, and a fresh (90-second) heartbeat. Process existence alone is not health. [Task 1]\n3482:- `scripts\\tradex_control.ps1` manages collector -> analysis worker -> MCP (8000) -> dashboard (8765), stopping in reverse. `start-all` remains idempotent; `restart-all` first stops all managed components, then starts all four, and `快捷工具\\一键全部启动.cmd` now calls it. Verify compatible process identity, project venv, process tree/start time, listening PID, current response, and worker heartbeat rather than state files/module names alone. [Task 4]\n3790:- `latest_accepted_real` can point to an exact canonical snapshot classified `stale_snapshot` because another component degraded. Permit only an exact matching `accepted_real`/`stale_snapshot` history row; reject derived heartbeats/unknown kinds. `item.latest` is nullable in sector UI. [Task 1]\n3940:- MarketWatchService is the sole owner of refresh, cache, single-flight and alert state; normal Web reads consume normalized snapshots and must not fan out to providers. Real snapshots win; `record(overwrite=False)` lets traceable stale heartbeats fill a collection gap without overwriting a same-minute real sample. [Task 2]\n3979:- The observed GitLab API was HTTP-only (`http://192.168.52.32`); a runner shown online/idle may still be unusable when its manager heartbeat is stale. Use isolated `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` plus per-host `api_protocol=http` rather than modifying global glab config. [Task 1]\n4664:- collection_store.py, history.py, mode=ro, query_only, lazy reconnect, partial schema, concurrent recovery, collector_heartbeat_at, COLLECTOR_HEARTBEAT_STALE_MS, 206 passed, Invoke-Pester, git diff --check\n4715:- `collection_store.py` and `history.py` can lazily reconnect under their locks in `mode=ro`/`query_only`: a missing DB creates nothing, a partial schema stays unavailable, a completed later schema is detected by the same singleton, and concurrent first recovery opens one connection. Collector supervision reopens persistence owners after a transient outer-cycle failure; dashboard health is `collector_state` + `collector_heartbeat_at` (90-second threshold), never PID existence. [Task 3]\n4722:- Tests that assert the old monolithic endpoint, `X-Tradex-Refresh-State`, or `refresh=1` are stale -> assert the endpoint layering, ETag/revision headers, manifest validation, full-batch discard, and heartbeat semantics instead. [Task 2]\n# 聪明板块库：股票市场归属判定方法\r\n\r\n状态：2026-09-18 方法确认；实施与验收进行中。本文是项目长期规则，后续任务与上下文压缩后必须先读。\r\n\r\n## 要解决的问题\r\n\r\n股票市场归属回答：市场将这只股票作为哪条产业主线、哪一环节的标的交易，而且该关系有真实业务支撑。它不是主营收入最大项、申万行业、供应商概念标签集合，也不等于某一天上涨的原因。\r\n\r\n市场可能围绕未来业务增量定价。不能因新业务收入占比较小就排除其市场主归属；也不能凭热点名词、参股、规划、传闻或短期相关性认定主归属。\r\n\r\n## 分析步骤与证据要求\r\n\r\n1. 汇集候选：读取供应商概念成员、概念解析、市场题材报道与已有归属记录。保留来源与日期，不按列表位置确定主次。\r\n2. 验证产业链位置：核对公司公告、定期报告、产品、客户合作、订单、交付等证据，说明公司到底提供什么产品或服务、位于产业链哪个环节。\r\n3. 验证市场认知：结合近期可追溯的题材事件、多个来源及持续性，判断主线与次要标签。概念成员只能证明被列入；统计联动只能提供佐证，不能独立证明因果。\r\n4. 综合判断：有真实产品/业务、市场认知支持的增量方向可以成为主归属，不机械按营收排序。仅投资关联、计划、传闻不得自动升级为主归属。\r\n5. 记录结果：市场主归属、产业链细分、其他业务/概念标签、主营背景、证据日期与链接、复核日期、判断理由和待核验事项分别保存。\r\n6. 管理变化：市场归属允许随业务和主线变化更新。历史记录保留当时版本；后来的证据不得反向改写历史判断。日级行情归因是另一种结果，不能用长期归属冒充当日涨跌原因。\r\n7. 无充分证据、来源冲突或证据过期时明确待核验，不伪造确定答案、贴合度分数或同向行情验证。\r\n\r\n用户已确认的证据标准：同花顺解析与另一发布方的公司业务资料逐项交叉核对，记录为 `crosschecked_sources`；有冲突或关键疑点再查原公告，完成后记录为 `official_disclosure`。仅有同花顺概念名称、多个网站转载同一概念名单，均不能满足业务核验。参股与控股经营、规划与已交付、下游用途与供应链订单等关键疑点须回原公告；无法解决则待核验。\r\n\r\n## 本次确认的校准样例\r\n\r\n这些案例用于检验方法，不是全市场唯一已分析的范围，也不能演变成页面里的股票代码特判。\r\n\r\n| 股票 | 市场主归属 | 产业链细分 | 保留的业务背景/其他标签 |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| 三花智控 002050.SZ | 人形机器人 | 机电执行器 | 汽车热管理、制冷空调零部件、液冷 |\r\n| 麦格米特 002851.SZ | AI算力 | AI服务器电源、数据中心供电 | 英伟达产业链、AIDC、高压直流供电；传统电力电子业务背景 |\r\n| 中大力德 002896.SZ | 人形机器人（机器人产业链） | 精密减速器、关节传动 | 关节模组、智能执行单元、工业自动化 |\r\n\r\n三花智控不能因热管理贡献主要收入就否定人形机器人市场归属。麦格米特不能因概念列表首项是第三代半导体，就让参股概念压过有实际产品与交付的AI电源。中大力德归属机器人链，同时保留减速器细分和人形机器人收入阶段信息。\r\n\r\n### 本次核对的公开证据\r\n\r\n- 三花智控公司披露（2026-08-27）：https://vip.stock.finance.sina.com.cn/corp/view/vCB_AllBulletinDetail.php?id=12563691&stockid=002050\r\n- 三花智控概念栏目：https://basic.10jqka.com.cn/002050/\r\n- 麦格米特2026半年报：https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-08-28/1225522762.PDF\r\n- 麦格米特英伟达供应链归类（2026-08-11）：https://news.10jqka.com.cn/20260811/c678863559.shtml\r\n- 中大力德2026半年报：https://vip.stock.finance.sina.com.cn/corp/view/vCB_AllBulletinDetail.php?id=12536111&stockid=002896\r\n- 中大力德概念解析：https://basic.10jqka.com.cn/002896/concept.html?cid=300900\r\n- 中大力德题材报道（2026-05-26）：https://yuanchuang.10jqka.com.cn/20260526/c676967984.shtml\r\n\r\n## 项目实施边界\r\n\r\n- 聪明板块库是股票市场归属的唯一读取和判定入口。页面、分析任务、选股、MCP不得各自维护映射、按关键词取第一个板块、用供应商行业顶替市场归属。\r\n- 现有证券关系目录继续保存主营、统计行业、原始概念与业务证据，作为聪明板块库的输入；这些字段不能被市场归属覆盖。\r\n- 板块指数本身的行情、资金流和统计行业同业比较有独立语义；统一股票市场归属不能静默更改这些数据口径。\r\n- 复用现有采集/分析进程、共享服务与本地目录。网页请求只读，不在打开页面时联网分析或逐股抓取。\r\n- 主页提供“聪明板块库”入口，二级界面能按板块/概念浏览对应股票，也能按股票查归属、细分、证据和状态；待核验及未覆盖不可隐藏。\r\n- 历史选股档案、当日涨停池及其他修订绑定结果必须保留原始日期/版本，当前归属更新不能伪装成历史时点已知信息。\r\n\r\n## 已确认的产品选择\r\n\r\n- 每只股票只发布一个市场主归属；普通页面及分析只展示该主归属。标签和产业链细分放在聪明板块库或明确指定的详情。\r\n- 统一所有股票市场归属的读取，板块行情与资金流来源保持原有口径。\r\n- 证据不足或尚未分析的股票明确显示“待核验”，禁止供应商标签补位。\r\n- 首轮范围是全市场5,567只，逐只核验；不得把先做少量热门股当成首轮完成。优先读取同花顺单股概念解析，批量失败时改逐股；来源不可读要记录具体缺口，不能把无法读取解释成没有该业务。\r\n- 原始资料采集、证据审查、主归属发布分别计数。采集成功不等于已核验；行业/概念名单不等于主归属结论。公司披露不足时保留待核验和所缺材料。\r\n- 当前证据默认每30个自然日需要复核；到期保留旧结论供审计，但不给普通消费者继续作为已核验主归属。重新读取旧材料不能自动续期。此期限为实现默认值，可由项目所有者调整。\r\n\r\n## 验收原则\r\n\r\n校准样例结论正确；同类业务可用共同规则处理；证据不足和冲突不硬归类；全部股票归属消费者统一入口；二级页可搜索、筛选、查看股票和依据；历史不被改写；真实运行进程和已提供页面/API载入本次版本。\r\n\r\n## 当前实现与接入约定\r\n\r\n业务入口为 `tradex.smart_sector_library.SmartSectorCatalog`，输出 `smart_sector_membership.v2`；普通消费者只读取 `primary_sector_name`。`status` 只有 `verified` 才能发布归属，`unresolved/stale/disputed` 都不得发布标签作为主归属。当前归属证据在 `market_membership_evidence.v2.json`，按股票和生效日期留存；指定历史日期时不能读取未来才复核的结论。\r\n\r\n| 消费者 | 归属读取及保护边界 |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| 每日选股、形态选股、盘中雷达与回溯表 | 当前库的单一主归属映射；原始策略档案和统计行业因子不重写 |\r\n| 涨停池 | 新日期股票分组从库读取；2026-09-18前的不可变档案保留原方法和原版本 |\r\n| 持仓前瞻与历史详情 | 新分析从库读取；历史详情按原分析日期读取库，独立于原档案正文与摘要哈希 |\r\n| 复盘观察股 | 按复盘日期从库读取；所属供应商指数的观察数据不改变口径 |\r\n| 风险偏好中的涨停领涨股 | 只按一个主归属计数；归属覆盖不全时不能以零匹配宣称板块中性 |\r\n| 公司信息、筛选、行业比较、概念工具 | 单独的市场归属来自库；供应商板块行情、统计同业比较明确标注各自口径 |\r\n| 聪明板块库页面 | `GET /api/smart-sector-library` 只读目录、证据和已发布研究进度；不在用户请求内联网采集 |\r\n\r\n`stock_sector_evidence.v1` 是补充资料的中立契约：供应商原字段由 gateway 归一化，来源没有数据日期时保留缺失标志，不能把抓取时间当数据日期。采集逐只保存，可断点续跑。东方财富补充请求走项目已有共享限流，不绕过它另建请求通道。同花顺直接访问被拒绝后使用可读取的网页工具；页面编码失败时可用明确指向同一股票页面的搜索摘录，搜索结果中的其他股票不能混入该股概念。\r\n\r\n来源研究快照 `smart_sector_research.v1` 由研究任务发布，页面只读。来源板块名称均标注未核验；其中可能包括指数、地域等供应商标签，不能直接当成业务归属。资料进度与正式核验数量分别显示。\r\n\r\n全市场验收仍要求逐只审查证据、记录结论或具体缺口。脚本取得5,567份材料、方法门槛校验通过或页面有5,567行，都不能独立证明这项验收完成。\r\n# 聪明板块库检查点（2026-09-18 23:52）\r\n\r\n用户已确认全市场5567只逐股核验；普通消费者一个主归属；标签只在库与特别详情；保留板块行情来源；证据不足待核验。最新确认：同花顺解析与公司业务资料交叉核对，有冲突或关键疑点再查原公告。方法文档已更新为正式要求。\r\n\r\n方法文档、AGENTS唯一入口、当前归属服务、消费者与主页二级页已实现并运行验收。**逐股审阅仅22只，已核验主归属15只，待核验5552只；全市场核验远未完成。** 原始资料采集不等于审查。\r\n\r\n同花顺浏览器session5757已退出：002926/002927/002928连续403。浏览器778页用7分47秒，约100页/分钟；350ms停顿偏短，已向用户坦诚说明。403疑似频率风控，不能证明具体规则。已修改collect-ths.cjs页间5000ms、首个403立即暂停，未重新启动。研究快照共保存1385只THS资料（此前网页工具600余只）。连续3次同阻塞后不再请求；恢复前须在正常浏览器确认失败页 https://basic.10jqka.com.cn/002926/concept.html 可读。旧web cells47/96均终止，不再wait。\r\n\r\n东方财富补充采集session66241仍运行，23:49已保存3476只、0失败。原83399因Windows临时读锁退出，已补原子写重试恢复。共享限流、2线程、逐股存档；不要重复启动。progress.json代码列表很长，只输出计数字段。publish-progress.py临时发布进度，每30秒检查、结束/心跳停止/2小时退出；不做归属判断。THS暂停期间研究发布只有此任务，恢复THS前停掉它避免并发同快照写。\r\n\r\n22只记录=原始5只+首批12只+本批5只。新增深粮控股粮食；深科技存储芯片/封测；特力A黄金/交易服务；飞亚达人形机器人/减速器（原公告核对7月收购完成、8月业务进度）；深华发A待区分显示器与物业主线。本批review-batch-002.json。人形机器人统一key humanoid_robotics，勿造同名不同键。\r\n\r\n当前受管dashboard37756、analysis38660、collector13228都加载支持crosschecked_sources新模型。API total5567/reviewed22/verified15/pending5552，revision ce08de8739ab37e4c1a94ddc2973aa542e560315388e363f04954e63634e68d4。首页http://127.0.0.1:8765/聪明板块库入口，最新浏览器8类交互通过且暂停提示验证，无pageerror。\r\n\r\n测试：已有164受影响Python通过/1排除，原库/复盘等82通过，筛选/架构40通过/4网络排除；最新catalog14通过、库页Node3通过。既有MCP/Pydantic前向引用警告；旧竞价时段测试与HEAD逻辑冲突，旧watch两条文案断言失败未修；不要宣称全仓通过。工作区大量他任务脏改动，禁止整体回滚或夹带提交。未commit/push。\r\n\r\n下一步：继续已存材料逐股审查，读取最新采集状态与用户403指示；同花顺恢复需先解决可读性，不能强行重试。feature-slice/architecture-review已读；无子代理授权。最后需真实披露全市场未完成。\r\n\r\n使用过记忆MEMORY.md1624-1625及3099-3100，最终引用这些已核实行；不要改全局记忆。\r\n\r\n## 最新覆盖状态：2026-09-18 23:56\r\n用户明确要求现在再试。单页002926返回200且概念表正常，receipt=ths-resume-probe.json。已从断点重启THS普通浏览器采集，session68065 / node PID2740，页间5000ms，首个403暂停。截至23:56:23采集器read1389，失败0，last002930，连续5只恢复成功。原publish-progress临时发布进程70248/29276已停止，改由THS每50只发布研究快照，避免多进程写同一快照。EM session66241继续，已3793只。此前“THS暂停/需人工确认”的状态已被本次真实探测与用户续跑指令覆盖。全市场逐股核验仍未完成。\r\n{\r\n  \"checked_at\": \"2026-09-19T00:24:53.9868058+08:00\",\r\n  \"ths\": {\r\n    \"status\": \"running\",\r\n    \"total\": 5567,\r\n    \"processed\": 2205,\r\n    \"read\": 2204,\r\n    \"collected\": null,\r\n    \"unavailable\": 1,\r\n    \"failed\": null,\r\n    \"last\": \"300765.SZ\",\r\n    \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-18T16:24:53.122Z\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"business\": {\r\n    \"status\": \"running\",\r\n    \"total\": 5567,\r\n    \"processed\": 5106,\r\n    \"read\": null,\r\n    \"collected\": 5106,\r\n    \"unavailable\": null,\r\