rationale\": \"市场旅游主题与具体运营资产逐项对应，链条以景区和旅游交通为主。摘帽为风险状态事件，银行投资和旧导游应用不能改变旅游归属。\"}], \"evidence\": [{\"evidence_id\": \"000430.SZ-ths\", \"source_kind\": \"provider_membership\", \"publisher\": \"同花顺\", \"title\": \"张家界概念解析\", \"source_url\": \"https://basic.10jqka.com.cn/000430/concept.html\", \"published_at\": null, \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-09-18T14:48:15+00:00\", \"assertions\": [\"旅游概念正文具体列景区经营、旅游客运、旅行社、客运索道和酒店，微信题材是景区智能导游应用。\"], \"content_sha256\": \"976c41999e8fda5af22669315045df48c422176021777aaa5318915069c80aa9\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"000430.SZ-company\", \"source_kind\": \"structured_provider\", \"publisher\": \"东方财富\", \"title\": \"张家界公司业务资料\", \"source_url\": \"https://emweb.eastmoney.com/PC_HSF10/CoreConception/PageAjax?code=SZ000430\", \"published_at\": null, \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-09-18T22:35:25.595755+08:00\", \"assertions\": [\"公司资料列宝峰湖、大庸古城、环保客运和观光电车、张家界中旅、杨家界索道及张国际酒店。\"], \"content_sha256\": \"01cf25fbd1893f3c86cc1be7c1f5220efe7c87980d0425a094b9cbb90337c8a5\"}], \"notes\": []}, {\"instrument_id\": \"000488.SZ\", \"name\": \"ST晨鸣\", \"reviewed_on\": \"2026-09-19\", \"effective_from\": \"2026-09-19\", \"review_due\": \"2026-10-19\", \"candidates\": [{\"sector_key\": \"paper\", \"sector_name\": \"造纸\", \"chain\": [\"制浆造纸\", \"白卡纸及文化纸\"], \"relation\": \"direct_business\", \"stage\": \"revenue\", \"market_role\": \"primary\", \"business_review_basis\": \"crosschecked_sources\", \"business_evidence_ids\": [\"000488.SZ-ths\", \"000488.SZ-company\"], \"market_evidence_ids\": [\"000488.SZ-ths\"], \"rationale\": \"纸品、纸浆与以纸代塑题材由直接生产业务支撑，构成一致造纸链条。ST是风险状态，不是产业板块；金融投资和参股技术企业不能替代主归属，也不据旧产能文字推断当前全部产线正常开工。\"}], \"evidence\": [{\"evidence_id\": \"000488.SZ-ths\", \"source_kind\": \"provider_membership\", \"publisher\": \"同花顺\", \"title\": \"ST晨鸣概念解析\", \"source_url\": \"https://basic.10jqka.com.cn/000488/concept.html\", \"published_at\": null, \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-09-18T14:48:19+00:00\", \"assertions\": [\"同股票搜索正文中以纸代塑说明白卡纸业务及浆纸配套，纸浆与人民币升值解析均围绕造纸业务；EDA和区块链为投资关系。\